          "markdown": "# Chapter 3 — Witness\r\n\r\nDistant summary, generated at chapter close (Spec1 4.3).\r\n\r\nIlse establishes that CP-114 cannot be revoked - the issuing authority no longer exists - and that Cadence cannot be argued with, because it has never lied. She publishes not the valley but the seam: the stacked passes, the zero variance, the raw returns disagreeing with the model by eighty metres. Tomas Wyre carries the twelve ledgers up to Meridian and reads the year fifty-one harvest weights aloud. CP-114 is superseded, Cadence flies the grid true on the eleventh, and Ilse signs a plot with the valley's own name on it.\r\n"
